sequenceDiagram
    participant User as Data Scientist<br/>(Python Code)
    participant SDK as Kubeflow SDK<br/>kubeflow.trainer
    participant Backend as Kubernetes Backend<br/>kubeflow.trainer.backends.kubernetes
    participant K8sClient as kubernetes Python Client<br/>CustomObjectsApi / CoreV1Api
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API Server<br/>HTTPS/6443
    participant Controller as Kubeflow Trainer Controller

    Note over User,Controller: Standard Training Job Flow

    User->>SDK: trainer = CustomTrainer(...)<br/>or HuggingFaceTrainer(...)
    SDK->>Backend: dispatch training definition
    Backend->>K8sClient: load_kube_config() or<br/>load_incluster_config()
    K8sClient-->>Backend: authenticated client

    Backend->>K8sClient: create_namespaced_custom_object()<br/>TrainJob CR
    K8sClient->>K8sAPI: POST /apis/kubeflow.org/v2alpha1/<br/>namespaces/{ns}/trainjobs<br/>Auth: kube-config / SA token
    K8sAPI-->>K8sClient: 201 Created
    K8sClient-->>Backend: TrainJob resource
    Backend-->>SDK: job handle
    SDK-->>User: training job submitted

    K8sAPI->>Controller: Watch event: TrainJob created
    Controller->>K8sAPI: Create training pods

    Note over User,Controller: RHAI Speculative Decoding Flow

    User->>SDK: trainer = SpeculativeDecodingTrainer(<br/>  model="llama3", draft_model="eagle3")
    SDK->>Backend: dispatch with RHAI config<br/>(draft model params, Eagle3 settings)
    Backend->>K8sClient: create_namespaced_custom_object()<br/>TrainJob CR with RHAI extensions
    K8sClient->>K8sAPI: POST TrainJob (RHAI-extended)
    K8sAPI-->>K8sClient: 201 Created
    K8sClient-->>Backend: TrainJob resource
    Backend-->>User: speculative decoding job submitted

    Note over User,Controller: Pipeline Integration Flow (Optional)

    User->>SDK: from kubeflow.pipelines import ...<br/>define pipeline components
    SDK->>K8sClient: pipeline execution via kfp SDK
    K8sClient->>K8sAPI: Create pipeline resources
    K8sAPI-->>User: pipeline run started
